  m_Name: Carta_PoloLogistico
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Polo Log\xEDstico"
  _titleEn: Logistics Hub
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Galp\xF5es de distribui\xE7\xE3o perto das rodovias atraem empresas
    e empregos e encurtam o caminho das mercadorias."
  _summaryEn: Distribution warehouses near highways attract companies and jobs and
    shorten the path of goods.
  _realWorld: "Cajamar, na Grande S\xE3o Paulo, virou um dos maiores polos log\xEDsticos
    do pa\xEDs, com centros de distribui\xE7\xE3o de grandes varejistas \xE0 beira
    das rodovias."
  _realWorldEn: "Cajamar, in Greater S\xE3o Paulo, has become one of Brazil's largest
    logistics hubs, with major retailers' distribution centers along the highways."
  _tradeOffs: "O tr\xE1fego de caminh\xF5es desgasta as vias, polui e congestiona,
    e muitos dos empregos pagam pouco."
  _tradeOffsEn: Truck traffic wears down roads, pollutes and congests, and many of
    the jobs pay little.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Cajamar (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cajamar
